  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Social Protection Programme 2 - FSD Moz - Women Economic Empowerment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Based on the successful implementation of the Child Grant, BHC Maputo through FSD Mozambique would like explore the space and feasibility of adding further complimentary activities to the Child Grant with a view to enhancing economic empowerment of the beneficiaries and improving household stability and economic standing.</narrative>
  </description>
